  "articleBody": "Start an open-concept kitchen remodel by defining how the connected rooms should work, then verify the existing structure, utilities, ventilation path, permits, and finish selections before construction begins. A coordinated design-build process can connect layout development, 3D visualization, material choices, permit coordination, construction, and final inspection into one project plan.",
